<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If thou wouldst be a conqueror,</l><l>Yea, more than conqueror thou,</l><l>If thou wilt shout in triumph</l><l>And claim the victory now;</l><l>The prison-doors will open,</l><l>The dungeon gleam with light,</l><l>And sin-chained souls around thee</l><l>Shall see thy Lord’s great might.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
